    "text": {
     "en": "Make a daily routine list, from the time you wake up till you sleep.\nIt should include a shower, handwashing with soap, brushing, 6 to 8 glasses of water, eating food, sleeping at least 8 hours and playing outside.\nCheck your list and see which habits you miss.\nIf something is difficult, think how to make it a habit.\nPlaying outside is good exercise."
    }
